      <Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 15, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>J. MacQueen, “Some methods for classification and analysis of multivariate observations,” <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>Proc. Fifth Berkeley Symp. Math. Statist. Probab.</span>, 1967, pp. 281–297.</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 14, paddingTop: 8, paddingBottom: 8, borderBottom: '1px solid #D6DCE5' }}>
      <Text style={{ width: 34, fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>[2]</Text>
      <Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 15, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>J. A. Hartigan and M. A. Wong, “Algorithm AS 136: A K-means clustering algorithm,” <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>J. R. Stat. Soc. C</span>, vol. 28, no. 1, pp. 100–108, 1979.</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 14, paddingTop: 8, paddingBottom: 8, borderBottom: '1px solid #D6DCE5' }}>
      <Text style={{ width: 34, fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>[3]</Text>
      <Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 15, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>P. J. Rousseeuw, “Silhouettes: a graphical aid to the interpretation and validation of cluster analysis,” <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>J. Comput. Appl. Math.</span>, vol. 20, pp. 53–65, 1987.</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 14, paddingTop: 8, paddingBottom: 8, borderBottom: '1px solid #D6DCE5' }}>
      <Text style={{ width: 34, fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>[4]</Text>
      <Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 15, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>D. L. Davies and D. W. Bouldin, “A cluster separation measure,” <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>IEEE Trans. Pattern Anal. Mach. Intell.</span>, vol. 1, no. 2, pp. 224–227, 1979.</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 14, paddingTop: 8, paddingBottom: 8, borderBottom: '1px solid #D6DCE5' }}>
      <Text style={{ width: 34, fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>[5]</Text>
      <Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 15, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>L. Hubert and P. Arabie, “Comparing partitions,” <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>J. Classification</span>, vol. 2, no. 1, pp. 193–218, 1985.</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 14, paddingTop: 8, paddingBottom: 8, borderBottom: '1px solid #D6DCE5' }}>
      <Text style={{ width: 34, fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>[6]</Text>
      <Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 15, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>M. Ester, H.-P. Kriegel, J. Sander, and X. Xu, “A density-based algorithm for discovering clusters in large spatial databases with noise,” <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>Proc. KDD</span>, 1996, pp. 226–231.</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 14, paddingTop: 8, paddingBottom: 8, borderBottom: '1px solid #D6DCE5' }}>
