      <Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 15, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>F. Pedregosa et al., “Scikit-learn: machine learning in Python,” <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>J. Mach. Learn. Res.</span>, vol. 12, pp. 2825–2830, 2011.</Text>
