      <Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 15, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>G. Punj and D. W. Stewart, “Cluster analysis in marketing research: review and suggestions for application,” <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>J. Marketing Research</span>, vol. 20, no. 2, pp. 134–148, 1983.</Text>
